    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "तीक्ष्ण: स्थूलहनुर्विशालवदन: पिङ्गेक्षणोऽल्पात्मज:",
   "bbox": [
    322,
    373,
    1032,
    448
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "स्त्रीद्वेषी प्रियमांसकानननगः कुप्यत्यकार्ये चिरम्।",
   "bbox": [
    326,
    442,
    1023,
    504
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "क्षुतृष्णोदरदन्तमानसरुजा संपीडितस्त्यागवान्",
   "bbox": [
    328,
    509,
    955,
    575
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "विक्रान्त: स्थिरधी: सुगर्वितमना मातुर्विधेयोऽर्कभे।। 5 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    328,
    568,
    1146,
    640
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "One born with Moon in Leo is full of anger with a thick",
   "bbox": [
    331,
    650,
    1476,
    724
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "chin, broad face, yellow eyes. He has very few issues (chil-",
   "bbox": [
    256,
    699,
    1475,
    777
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "dren). Is opposed to women in general. Likes to eat meat and",
   "bbox": [
    259,
    751,
    1476,
    825
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "visit jungles and mountains. Is angry for lapses by others. Is",
   "bbox": [
    259,
    801,
    1478,
    878
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "much troubled by diseases of the hunger, thirst, belly, teeth",
   "bbox": [
    260,
    851,
    1479,
    927
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and those relating to mind. He is giver of alms, full of valour,",
   "bbox": [
    262,
    902,
    1478,
    979
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of steadfast mind and proud disposition and is devoted to his",
   "bbox": [
    263,
    951,
    1481,
    1031
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "mother.",
   "bbox": [
    265,
    1032,
    426,
    1072
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon in Virgo",
   "bbox": [
    266,
    1130,
    649,
    1182
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "व्रीडामन्थरचारुवीक्षणगति: स्रस्तांसबाहु: सुखी",
   "bbox": [
    343,
    1202,
    1005,
    1266
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "श्लक्ष्ण: सत्यरत: कलासु निपुण: शास्त्रार्थविद्धार्मिक:।",
   "bbox": [
    344,
    1260,
    1122,
    1336
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मेधावी सुरतप्रिय: परगृहैर्वित्तैश्च संयुज्यते",
   "bbox": [
    342,
    1328,
    929,
    1401
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कन्यायां परदेशगः प्रियवचाः कन्याप्रजोऽल्पात्मजः।। 6 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    346,
    1395,
    1183,
    1457
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "One born with Moon in Virgo has a gait marked by bash-",
   "bbox": [
    350,
    1480,
    1492,
    1549
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "fulness, slow motion and pleasing glances. He is somewhat",
   "bbox": [
    272,
    1526,
    1494,
    1605
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "weak in the region of arms and shoulders. Happy with a clear",
   "bbox": [
    276,
    1578,
    1494,
    1653
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and truthful speech. He is adept in arts (Handicrafts etc),",
   "bbox": [
    276,
    1630,
    1495,
    1703
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "informed in the matter of religions and is religious in actions,",
   "bbox": [
    276,
    1678,
    1495,
    1756
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "jas a very keen intellect, loves sex, has occasion to get house",
   "bbox": [
    276,
    1731,
    1498,
    1804
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and wealth belonging to others, lives in another country or",
   "bbox": [
    281,
    1781,
    1498,
    1857
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "province, is sweet in speech and has many daughters and very",
   "bbox": [
    282,
    1831,
    1498,
    1907
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "few sons.",
   "bbox": [
    282,
    1910,
    470,
    1948
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon in Libra",
   "bbox": [
    282,
    2004,
    663,
    2055
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "देवब्राह्मणसाधुपूजनरतः प्राज्ञः शुचिः स्त्रिजितः",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    2082,
    1029,
    2143
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "प्रांशुश्चोन्नतनासिक: कृशचलद्गात्रोऽटनोऽर्थान्वित:।",
   "bbox": [
    362,
